&lt;tr style="height:22.5pt;min-height:22.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="3" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:23.5pt;padding-right:5.7pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-17.9pt;"&gt;(1) 連結貸借対照表計上額が取得原価を超えるもの&lt;/p&gt;
